/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The Gaz AQMS automatic ambient air quality monitoring system provides real-time monitoring of air quality in a specific area, forming a comprehensive  network for continuous sampling and analysis. It is primarily used by environmental protection agencies, power, petroleum, chemical, steel, metallurgical, and construction industries, as well as large airports.  Additionally, it supports monitoring of air quality and meteorological parameters for traffic pollution, scientific research, and environmental quality assessments.)
/E (The Gaz AQMS automatic ambient air quality monitoring system provides real-time monitoring of air quality in a specific area, forming a comprehensive  network for continuous sampling and analysis. It is primarily used by environmental protection agencies, power, petroleum, chemical, steel, metallurgical, and construction industries, as well as large airports.  Additionally, it supports monitoring of air quality and meteorological parameters for traffic pollution, scientific research, and environmental quality assessments.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
